{"id": "EUVD-2026-107007", "enisaUuid": "f0c6c3ec-295a-32d5-9627-59ec11ae3012", "description": "ArcadeDB from 26.8.1 before 26.10.1 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows read-only users to modify edge type lightweight and unique schema flags without UPDATE_SCHEMA permission. Attackers can send a bare ALTER TYPE edgeType WITH lightweight = true command over the HTTP, gRPC, or Bolt command API to persistently alter edge storage declarations.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T00:36:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T00:36:31", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/ArcadeData/arcadedb/security/advisories/GHSA-9c7g-grf7-j2r5", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/arcadedb-from-26.8.1-before-26.10.1-authorization-bypass-via-alter-type-with"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-114056", "GHSA-7762-mmrx-x9p5"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6027c3f8-63e7-352c-94e9-d68cf3fe2c5f", "product": {"name": "arcadedb", "vendor": {"name": "ArcadeData"}}, "product_version": "26.8.1 <26.10.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "01dbeacc-a7ca-3c6d-8e82-fdc928406b7c", "vendor": {"name": "ArcadeData"}}], "isExploited": false}